WEBVTT

00:04:28.347 --> 00:04:31.017
it would be called “Winter Is Here.”

00:04:32.184 --> 00:04:36.647
And the subtitle would be
"I Bleeping Told You So."

00:04:36.689 --> 00:04:38.691
(Laughter)

00:04:40.151 --> 00:04:43.779
Actually, my first article of warning

00:04:43.821 --> 00:04:45.823
was published in
“The Wall Street Journal”

00:04:45.865 --> 00:04:48.034
on January 4, 2001.

00:04:49.827 --> 00:04:52.788
I saw evil because I heard evil.

00:04:53.080 --> 00:04:55.207
Putin was telling us what he was.

00:04:55.207 --> 00:04:57.877
All we had to do was listen.

00:04:58.794 --> 00:05:04.467
When Putin said that there was
no such thing as a former KGB agent,